{"word":"buck","ipa":"bʌk","persianMeaning":"اسب ژیمناستیک، اسکناس یک دلاری","englishDefinition":"n. United States author whose novels drew on her experiences as a missionary in China (1892-1973)\\nn. mature male of various mammals (especially deer or antelope)\\nv. to strive with determination\\nv. resist","partOfSpeech":"noun","example":"The gymnast sprinted toward the buck and executed a perfect vault.","examplePersian":"ورزشکار روی اسب ژیمناستیک پرید.","cefrLevel":"C1","synonyms":[],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"wordFamily":[],"commonMistakes":"","ieltsRelevance":"High","toeflRelevance":"Medium","greRelevance":"High","tags":["IELTS","offline","ECDICT","gre","ielts","needs-collocation"],"source":"ECDICT + Openjam + EnglishToPersianDictionaries","sourceLicense":"ECDICT MIT; Openjam MIT; EnglishToPersianDictionaries Apache-2.0","frequencyRank":5194,"examPriority":3}
