{"word":"buckle","ipa":"'bʌkl","persianMeaning":"تقله، گیره، پیچش، خم شدگی، با تقله بستن، فروریختن، خم شدن","englishDefinition":"n. fastener that fastens together two ends of a belt or strap; often has loose prong\\nv. fasten with a buckle or buckles\\nv. fold or collapse","partOfSpeech":"noun","example":"The metal buckle on my belt keeps coming loose and falling off.","examplePersian":"تقله کمربند را ببند تا شلخته نشود.","cefrLevel":"C2","synonyms":[],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"wordFamily":[],"commonMistakes":"","ieltsRelevance":"High","toeflRelevance":"High","greRelevance":"High","tags":["IELTS","offline","ECDICT","gre","ielts","toefl","needs-collocation"],"source":"ECDICT + Openjam + EnglishToPersianDictionaries","sourceLicense":"ECDICT MIT; Openjam MIT; EnglishToPersianDictionaries Apache-2.0","frequencyRank":14910,"examPriority":3}
{"word":"bud","ipa":"bʌd","persianMeaning":"گل نیمه باز، جوانه (بر روی ساقه گیاه)، جوانه دادن، شروع به رشد کردن","englishDefinition":"n. a partially opened flower\\nn. a swelling on a plant stem consisting of overlapping immature leaves or petals\\nv. develop buds\\nv. start to grow or develop","partOfSpeech":"noun","example":"The rose bud will bloom into a beautiful flower within a few days.","examplePersian":"بوی خوش از گل نیمه باز می‌آمد.","cefrLevel":"C1","synonyms":[],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"wordFamily":[],"commonMistakes":"","ieltsRelevance":"High","toeflRelevance":"High","greRelevance":"High","tags":["IELTS","offline","ECDICT","cet4","cet6","gre","ielts","ky","toefl","needs-collocation","CEFR-J"],"source":"ECDICT + Openjam + EnglishToPersianDictionaries; CEFR-J 1.5","sourceLicense":"ECDICT MIT; Openjam MIT; EnglishToPersianDictionaries Apache-2.0; CEFR-J commercial use with attribution","frequencyRank":6218,"examPriority":3}
{"word":"budget","ipa":"'bʌdʒit","persianMeaning":"بودجه، اعتبار، برنامه ریزی هزینه ها","englishDefinition":"n. a sum of money allocated for a particular purpose\\nn. a summary of intended expenditures along with proposals for how to meet them\\nv. make a budget","partOfSpeech":"noun","example":"the laboratory runs on a budget of a million a year","examplePersian":"بودجه سالانه شرکت میلیارد تومان تعیین شد.","cefrLevel":"B1","synonyms":[],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"wordFamily":[],"commonMistakes":"","ieltsRelevance":"High","toeflRelevance":"High","greRelevance":"High","tags":["IELTS","offline","ECDICT","cet4","cet6","gk","gre","ielts","ky","toefl","needs-collocation","NGSL","CEFR-J"],"source":"ECDICT + Openjam + EnglishToPersianDictionaries; NGSL 1.2; CEFR-J 1.5","sourceLicense":"ECDICT MIT; Openjam MIT; EnglishToPersianDictionaries Apache-2.0; NGSL/NAWL CC BY-SA 4.0; CEFR-J commercial use with attribution","frequencyRank":1016,"examPriority":3}
