{"word":"bug","ipa":"bʌg","persianMeaning":"حشره، اشکال یا خرابی در برنامه کامپیوتری","englishDefinition":"n. general term for any insect or similar creeping or crawling invertebrate\\nn. a fault or defect in a computer program, system, or machine\\nn. a small hidden microphone; for listening secretly","partOfSpeech":"noun","example":"I found a tiny bug crawling across the kitchen counter this morning.","examplePersian":"یک حشره کوچک روی دیوار نشسته است.","cefrLevel":"C1","synonyms":[],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"wordFamily":[],"commonMistakes":"","ieltsRelevance":"High","toeflRelevance":"Medium","greRelevance":"Medium","tags":["IELTS","offline","ECDICT","cet6","ielts","ky","needs-collocation","CEFR-J"],"source":"ECDICT + Openjam + EnglishToPersianDictionaries; CEFR-J 1.5","sourceLicense":"ECDICT MIT; Openjam MIT; EnglishToPersianDictionaries Apache-2.0; CEFR-J commercial use with attribution","frequencyRank":5105,"examPriority":3}
