{"word":"bulb","ipa":"bʌlb","persianMeaning":"پیاز (گیاه)، لامپ","englishDefinition":"n. a modified bud consisting of a thickened globular underground stem serving as a reproductive structure\\nn. a rounded part of a cylindrical instrument (usually at one end)\\nn. anything with a round shape resembling a teardrop\\nn. a rounded dilation or expansion in a canal or vessel or organ","partOfSpeech":"noun","example":"I planted tulip bulbs in the garden last fall for spring blooms.","examplePersian":"پیاز لالە در بهار رشد می‌کند.","cefrLevel":"C2","synonyms":[],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"wordFamily":[],"commonMistakes":"","ieltsRelevance":"High","toeflRelevance":"High","greRelevance":"High","tags":["IELTS","offline","ECDICT","cet4","cet6","gre","ielts","ky","toefl","needs-collocation","CEFR-J"],"source":"ECDICT + Openjam + EnglishToPersianDictionaries; CEFR-J 1.5","sourceLicense":"ECDICT MIT; Openjam MIT; EnglishToPersianDictionaries Apache-2.0; CEFR-J commercial use with attribution","frequencyRank":11846,"examPriority":3}
