{"word":"bulk","ipa":"bʌlk","persianMeaning":"بخش بزرگتر، قسمت اصلی، حجم بزرگ، اندازه بسیار زیاد","englishDefinition":"n. the property of something that is great in magnitude\\nn. the property possessed by a large mass\\nv. stick out or up","partOfSpeech":"noun","example":"the majority of his customers prefer it","examplePersian":"بخش اعظم افراد با این تصمیم موافق بودند.","cefrLevel":"C1","synonyms":[],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"wordFamily":[],"commonMistakes":"","ieltsRelevance":"High","toeflRelevance":"High","greRelevance":"High","tags":["IELTS","offline","ECDICT","cet4","cet6","gre","ielts","ky","toefl","needs-collocation","NAWL"],"source":"ECDICT + Openjam + EnglishToPersianDictionaries; NAWL 1.2","sourceLicense":"ECDICT MIT; Openjam MIT; EnglishToPersianDictionaries Apache-2.0; NGSL/NAWL CC BY-SA 4.0","frequencyRank":5195,"examPriority":4}
{"word":"bull","ipa":"bul","persianMeaning":"گاو نر، مردی بزرگ و قوی و چاق","englishDefinition":"n. uncastrated adult male of domestic cattle\\nn. a large and strong and heavyset man\\nn. a serious and ludicrous blunder\\nn. uncomplimentary terms for a policeman","partOfSpeech":"noun","example":"The farmer's bull was kept in a separate pasture away from the cows.","examplePersian":"گاو نر بزرگ و قوی در مزرعه چرا می‌کرد.","cefrLevel":"B2","synonyms":[],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"wordFamily":[],"commonMistakes":"","ieltsRelevance":"High","toeflRelevance":"Medium","greRelevance":"Medium","tags":["IELTS","offline","ECDICT","cet4","cet6","ielts","ky","needs-collocation","CEFR-J"],"source":"ECDICT + Openjam + EnglishToPersianDictionaries; CEFR-J 1.5","sourceLicense":"ECDICT MIT; Openjam MIT; EnglishToPersianDictionaries Apache-2.0; CEFR-J commercial use with attribution","frequencyRank":4005,"examPriority":3}
{"word":"bulletin","ipa":"'bulitin","persianMeaning":"بیانیه، اطلاعیه","englishDefinition":"n. a brief report (especially an official statement issued for immediate publication or broadcast)\\nv. make public by bulletin","partOfSpeech":"noun","example":"The hospital issued a bulletin confirming the patient's successful recovery this morning.","examplePersian":"خبرگزاری یک بولتن رسمی درباره وضعیت آب و هوا منتشر کرد.","cefrLevel":"C2","synonyms":[],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"wordFamily":[],"commonMistakes":"","ieltsRelevance":"High","toeflRelevance":"Medium","greRelevance":"Medium","tags":["IELTS","offline","ECDICT","cet6","ielts","ky","needs-collocation","CEFR-J"],"source":"ECDICT + Openjam + EnglishToPersianDictionaries; CEFR-J 1.5","sourceLicense":"ECDICT MIT; Openjam MIT; EnglishToPersianDictionaries Apache-2.0; CEFR-J commercial use with attribution","frequencyRank":9715,"examPriority":3}
{"word":"bully","ipa":"'buli","persianMeaning":"شرور، آدم ظالم و بی‌رحم، مزدور، کسی که برای آزار دیگری استخدام شود، تحت فشار قرار دادن، سلطه‌جویی کردن، تهدید کردن، ترساندن، دهش‌تافزایی کردن","englishDefinition":"n. a cruel and brutal fellow\\nn. a hired thug","partOfSpeech":"noun","example":"That bully at school pushed around smaller kids every single day.","examplePersian":"آن بولی همیشه از دانش‌آموزان ضعیف‌تر آزار می‌گیرد.","cefrLevel":"C2","synonyms":[],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"wordFamily":[],"commonMistakes":"","ieltsRelevance":"High","toeflRelevance":"High","greRelevance":"High","tags":["IELTS","offline","ECDICT","gre","ielts","ky","toefl","needs-collocation","CEFR-J"],"source":"ECDICT + Openjam + EnglishToPersianDictionaries; CEFR-J 1.5","sourceLicense":"ECDICT MIT; Openjam MIT; EnglishToPersianDictionaries Apache-2.0; CEFR-J commercial use with attribution","frequencyRank":7424,"examPriority":3}
{"word":"bump","ipa":"bʌmp","persianMeaning":"توده‌ای بر روی بدن ناشی از ضربه، برآمدگی یا نتوء بر روی سطح، برخورد کردن با نیروی قوی، تصادفی به کسی یا چیزی برخورد کردن","englishDefinition":"n. a lump on the body caused by a blow\\nv. knock against with force or violence\\nv. dance erotically or dance with the pelvis thrust forward","partOfSpeech":"noun","example":"She had a nasty bump on her forehead after hitting the cabinet door.","examplePersian":"پس از سقوط، توده‌ای بزرگ بر روی پیشانی‌اش ایجاد شد.","cefrLevel":"C2","synonyms":[],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"wordFamily":[],"commonMistakes":"","ieltsRelevance":"High","toeflRelevance":"High","greRelevance":"High","tags":["IELTS","offline","ECDICT","cet6","gre","ielts","ky","toefl","needs-collocation","CEFR-J"],"source":"ECDICT + Openjam + EnglishToPersianDictionaries; CEFR-J 1.5","sourceLicense":"ECDICT MIT; Openjam MIT; EnglishToPersianDictionaries Apache-2.0; CEFR-J commercial use with attribution","frequencyRank":7316,"examPriority":3}
{"word":"bumper","ipa":"'bʌmpә","persianMeaning":"لیوان پر تا لب، سپر جلو یا عقب خودرو","englishDefinition":"n. a glass filled to the brim (especially as a toast)\\nn. a mechanical device consisting of bars at either end of a vehicle to absorb shock and prevent serious damage","partOfSpeech":"noun","example":"we quaffed a bumper of ale","examplePersian":"او یک لیوان پر تا لب شراب برای تست بلند کرد.","cefrLevel":"C2","synonyms":[],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"wordFamily":[],"commonMistakes":"","ieltsRelevance":"High","toeflRelevance":"Medium","greRelevance":"Medium","tags":["IELTS","offline","ECDICT","ielts","needs-collocation","CEFR-J"],"source":"ECDICT + Openjam + EnglishToPersianDictionaries; CEFR-J 1.5","sourceLicense":"ECDICT MIT; Openjam MIT; EnglishToPersianDictionaries Apache-2.0; CEFR-J commercial use with attribution","frequencyRank":11351,"examPriority":3}
{"word":"bunch","ipa":"bʌntʃ","persianMeaning":"گروه، دسته، گروه دوستان، جمع","englishDefinition":"n. a grouping of a number of similar things\\nn. any collection in its entirety\\nv. gather or cause to gather into a cluster","partOfSpeech":"noun","example":"a bunch of trees","examplePersian":"یک دسته از گل‌های قشنگ روی میز قرار داشت.","cefrLevel":"B1","synonyms":[],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"wordFamily":[],"commonMistakes":"","ieltsRelevance":"High","toeflRelevance":"High","greRelevance":"Medium","tags":["IELTS","offline","ECDICT","cet4","cet6","gk","ielts","ky","toefl","needs-collocation","NGSL","CEFR-J"],"source":"ECDICT + Openjam + EnglishToPersianDictionaries; NGSL 1.2; CEFR-J 1.5","sourceLicense":"ECDICT MIT; Openjam MIT; EnglishToPersianDictionaries Apache-2.0; NGSL/NAWL CC BY-SA 4.0; CEFR-J commercial use with attribution","frequencyRank":2612,"examPriority":3}
{"word":"bundle","ipa":"'bʌndl","persianMeaning":"بسته‌ای از چیزهایی که با هم بسته‌بندی یا جعبه‌بندی شده‌اند، بسته‌ای از چندین چیز که برای حمل یا نگهداری کنار هم بسته شده‌اند","englishDefinition":"n. a package of several things tied together for carrying or storing\\nv. make into a bundle\\nv. sleep fully clothed in the same bed with one's betrothed","partOfSpeech":"noun","example":"I bought a bundle of batteries at the store yesterday.","examplePersian":"من یک بسته از کتاب‌ها را از فروشگاه خریدم.","cefrLevel":"C2","synonyms":[],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"wordFamily":[],"commonMistakes":"","ieltsRelevance":"High","toeflRelevance":"High","greRelevance":"Medium","tags":["IELTS","offline","ECDICT","cet4","cet6","ielts","ky","toefl","needs-collocation","NAWL"],"source":"ECDICT + Openjam + EnglishToPersianDictionaries; NAWL 1.2","sourceLicense":"ECDICT MIT; Openjam MIT; EnglishToPersianDictionaries Apache-2.0; NGSL/NAWL CC BY-SA 4.0","frequencyRank":7890,"examPriority":4}
