{"word":"canadian","ipa":"kә'neidiәn","persianMeaning":"ساکن یا اهل کانادا، رودخانه‌ای در شمال‌شرق نیومکزیکو، مربوط به کانادا یا مردم آن","englishDefinition":"n. a native or inhabitant of Canada\\nn. a river rising in northeastern New Mexico and flowing eastward across the Texas panhandle to become a tributary of the Arkansas River in Oklahoma\\na. of or relating to Canada or its people","partOfSpeech":"noun","example":"My friend Sarah is a Canadian who moved to Toronto last year.","examplePersian":"او یک کانادایی است و در تورنتو زندگی می‌کند.","cefrLevel":"B1","synonyms":[],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"wordFamily":[],"commonMistakes":"","ieltsRelevance":"High","toeflRelevance":"Medium","greRelevance":"Medium","tags":["IELTS","offline","ECDICT","gk","ielts","needs-collocation"],"source":"ECDICT + Openjam + EnglishToPersianDictionaries","sourceLicense":"ECDICT MIT; Openjam MIT; EnglishToPersianDictionaries Apache-2.0","frequencyRank":2031,"examPriority":3}
{"word":"canal","ipa":"kә'næl","persianMeaning":"کانال‌های مریخ (ویژگی‌های سطحی مریخ که در گذشته فکر می‌شد کانال‌های آب باشند)، کانال بدن (لوله یا مجرای بدن که یک ترشح یا ماده دیگری را منتقل می‌کند)","englishDefinition":"n. (astronomy) an indistinct surface feature of Mars once thought to be a system of channels; they are now believed to be an optical illusion\\nn. long and narrow strip of water made for boats or for irrigation\\nv. provide (a city) with a canal","partOfSpeech":"noun","example":"Early astronomers mistakenly believed they saw a canal network crossing Mars's surface.","examplePersian":"دانشمندان قدیم کانال‌های مریخ را می‌دیدند، اما این فقط یک توهم نوری بود.","cefrLevel":"B2","synonyms":[],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"wordFamily":[],"commonMistakes":"","ieltsRelevance":"High","toeflRelevance":"High","greRelevance":"Medium","tags":["IELTS","offline","ECDICT","cet4","cet6","gk","ielts","ky","toefl","needs-collocation","CEFR-J"],"source":"ECDICT + Openjam + EnglishToPersianDictionaries; CEFR-J 1.5","sourceLicense":"ECDICT MIT; Openjam MIT; EnglishToPersianDictionaries Apache-2.0; CEFR-J commercial use with attribution","frequencyRank":4924,"examPriority":3}
